BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 380.17 Tm (is a no-no. Adding the adjustment and then discounting it back off for cash payers is what the card brands) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 364.95 Tm (call an effective surcharge, which puts the merchant back under the debit ban and the 3% cap) Tj ET
