BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 610.65 Tm (arguing that one-, two- and three-year agreements do not give enough runway to earn the purchase price) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 595.42 Tm (back if the business struggles [kbluVa_rgsM @ 00:02:21]. Austin Lewis runs the same default, five years) Tj ET
